      "message": "test(setup-align): expect the named edm.codes.side refusal for a sinker side burn\n\nThe aligned-setup sinker test posts a Side Burn on the synthetic\ndialect, which states no edm.codes.side. Since #3001 the post refuses\nit by naming the missing code, not with the old \"moves the electrode\nsideways\" text. Pin the new text and pin that the straight burn in the\nsame program is not the refused part. Decision record updated.\n\nRefs #3001\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
